  "description": "Handsome, the youngest son of a chaebol family, and a famous poet. Tae-Eun (the poet), a man anyone would fall in love with, meets Yeon-Woo (the cartoonist), who is cold toward him, and for the first time in his life, he tries his hardest to be loved by someone.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
